{"results":[{"url":"https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/amann-solitaire/63403/project","title":"Amann Solitaire, Borivali West, Mumbai - Price on Request","raw_content":"![Squareyards Logo](/assets/images/squareyards.png?aio=w-82;h-32;crop;)\n![Amann Infradevelopment Ltd developer logo](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/developerlogo/developer-img.jpg?aio=w-128;h-128;crop;)\n\n# Amann Solitaire Borivali West, Mumbai\n\n![Amann Solitaire Cover Image](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/amann-solitaire-project-project-large-image1.jpg?aio=w-725;h-350;crop;)\n![Amann Solitaire Tower View](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/amann-solitaire-project-tower-view1.jpg?aio=w-192;h-168;crop;)\n\n**Price on Request**\n\n## Amann Solitaire Price List, Price Trends and Market Insights\n\n### Price List\n\nView the latest price list for Amann Solitaire.\n\n| Unit Type (Saleable) | Price\\* | Action |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 2 BHK Apartment  1375 Sq. Ft. | **Price on Request** | Check Availability |\n| 3 BHK Apartment  1825 Sq. Ft. | **Price on Request** | Check Availability |\n\n\\*Prices are indicative and subject to applicable charges and project terms.\n\n### Price Trends\n\nAmann Solitaire's average asking price is cooling quarter-on-quarter, compared with Borivali West.\n\nSep 2025 — Jun 2026\n\n| Quarter | Amann Solitaire | Borivali West |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Jun 2026 | 26450 | 30750 |\n| Mar 2026 | 38750 | 31300 |\n| Dec 2025 | 38750 | 30300 |\n| Sep 2025 | 28950 | 30350 |\n\n### Comparable Projects\n\nAmann Solitaire avg. price is ₹ 26.4 K/Sq.Ft. compared to Borivali West at ₹ 30.8 K/Sq.Ft.\n\n| Project | Avg. ₹/sq ft |\n| --- | --- |\n| [Kalpataru Gardens 2](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/kalpataru-gardens-2/3226/project \"Kalpataru Gardens 2\") | ₹ 46,050 |\n| [Kalpataru Gardens 1](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/kalpataru-gardens-1/3239/project \"Kalpataru Gardens 1\") | ₹ 39,600 |\n| [Mayfair Greens](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/mayfair-greens/28962/project \"Mayfair Greens\") | ₹ 34,100 |\n| Borivali West | ₹ 30,750 |\n| Current Project **Amann Solitaire** | ₹ 26,450 |\n\n### Rentals\n\nMonthly Rent in Amann Solitaire ranges from ₹ 60 K to ₹ 80 K with options available for 2,3 BHK units\n\n| Configuration | In Amann Solitaire | In Borivali West |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 1 BHK | - | ₹ 32.7 K |\n| 2 BHK | ₹ 60 K | ₹ 45.5 K |\n| 3 BHK | ₹ 80 K | ₹ 74.4 K |\n\n### Recent Updates\n\nGet the latest price and market updates for Amann Solitaire.\n\n#### Mumbai's Water Stock at 95.97% with Seven Lakes Holding High Levels\n\nMumbai's water stock has reached 95.97%, with seven lakes maintaining high levels. This ensures a stable water supply for the city, though civic authorities continue to monitor reservoir levels and rainfall.\n\nA total of 1 residential transactions has been registered so far for Amann Solitaire, amounting to ₹ 2 Cr till September 2026.\n\nRent in Amann Solitaire ranges from ₹ 60 K to ₹ 80 K with options available for 2 BHK, 3 BHK.\n\n#### MMRDA Presents Surplus Budget with Significant Allocation for Infrastructure\n\nMMRDA has presented a surplus budget of ₹48,072 crore, with 87% allocated to infrastructure projects, including roads, public transport, and urban development. A notable provision of ₹4,000 crore is earmarked for the development of Mumbai 3.0 New Town, aiming for planned urban expansion.\n\n#### BMC Budget Includes ₹6,475 Crore for Water Security Projects\n\nThe BMC's FY26-27 budget includes a substantial allocation of ₹6,475 crore for water security initiatives. This funding is designated for projects such as the Manori desalination plant (₹500 crore) and the Gargai project (₹437.51 crore), aimed at augmenting the city's water supply capacity.\n\n#### Mumbai-Pune Expressway 'Missing Link' Project Set for May 1 Inauguration, Promising Safer and Faster Travel\n\nThe highly anticipated 'Missing Link' project on the Mumbai-Pune Expressway is set to be inaugurated on May 1, significantly reducing travel time by approximately 30 minutes and enhancing safety. The 10.5-km stretch features tunnels and a bridge, bypassing the accident-prone Khandala Ghat. This infrastructure upgrade is expected to ease traffic congestion, improve travel safety.\n\nDuring Q4'2025, average property prices for Amann Solitaire moved from ₹ 28,950/sqft to ₹ 38,750/sqft, reflecting a 33.85% rise.\n\n### Govt. Registrations\n\n1 Sales Transactions Registered in Amann Solitaire From Oct 25 to Sep 26 at Avg. Price ₹ 16.9 K/Sq.Ft.\n\n| Sales Transactions | Gross Sales Value | Registered Rate |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 1 | ₹ 2 Cr | ₹ 16,950 / Sq. Ft. |\n\nTransaction Period Oct 25 to Sep 26\n\n## Amann Solitaire Floor Plans\n\n![Representative image for Floor plan of 2 BHK 1375 Sq. Ft. Apartment in Amann Solitaire, Mumbai](/assets/images/floor-plans-coming-soon.svg)\n\nPrice:Price on Request\n\n![Representative image for Floor plan of 3 BHK 1825 Sq. Ft. Apartment in Amann Solitaire, Mumbai](/assets/images/floor-plans-coming-soon.svg)\n\nPrice:Price on Request\n\n## Resale & Rental Listings in Amann Solitaire\n\nExplore resale and rental listings currently available in Amann Solitaire, Mumbai.\n\n![2 BHK Apartment For Sale in Amann Solitaire in Borivali West, Mumbai]()\n\nBorivali West, Mumbai\n\n![Sunil Ransure  profile picture]()\n![2 BHK Apartment For Sale in Amann Solitaire in Borivali West, Mumbai]()\n\nBorivali West, Mumbai\n\n![2 BHK Apartment For Sale in Amann Solitaire in Borivali West, Mumbai]()\n\nBorivali West, Mumbai\n\n![2 BHK + Pooja Room Apartment For Sale in Amann Solitaire in Borivali West, Mumbai]()\n\nBorivali West, Mumbai\n\n![3 BHK Apartment For Sale in Amann Solitaire in Borivali West, Mumbai]()\n\nBorivali West, Mumbai\n\n![Sunil Ransure  profile picture]()\n![3 BHK Apartment For Sale in Amann Solitaire