ince my experiences feel subdued and balanced. Nearby markets daily and excellent schools are good. Weekend beach time and runs close to SGNP are something I like. Andheri and Goregaon are simple for me to work in. Parking problems and traffic jams call for quick solutions.\n\n— Suresh Sanghvi, Tenant\n\n## RERA Details of Amann Solitaire\n\n## Property Registration Data\n\n1 Sales Transactions Registered in Amann Solitaire From Oct 25 to Sep 26 at Avg. Price ₹ 16.9 K/Sq.Ft.\n\n| Registry Date | Floor/Unit | Tower/Wing | Area | Transaction Value | Rate/Sq. Ft. | Actions |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| 2026-01-23 | Floor 17, Unit 1702 | N/A | 1,142 Sq. Ft. |  |  | Index    Agreement |\n\n## How does Amann Solitaire compare with similar projects?\n\n![Amann Solitaire project in Borivali West, Mumbai](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-amann-solitaire-project-flagship1.jpg?aio=w-229;h-150;crop;)\n\n### [Amann Solitaire](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/amann-solitaire/63403/project \"Amann Solitaire\")\n\nBorivali West, Mumbai\n\n![Ajmera Pristine project in Borivali West, Mumbai](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-ajmera-pristine-project-flagship1.jpg?aio=w-229;h-150;crop;)\n\n### [Ajmera Pristine](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/ajmera-pristine/2996/project \"Ajmera Pristine\")\n\nBorivali West, Mumbai\n\n![The Wadhwa Aquaria Grande project in Borivali West, Mumbai](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-the-wadhwa-aquaria-grande-project-flagship1.jpg?aio=w-229;h-150;crop;)\n\n### [The Wadhwa Aquaria Grande](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/the-wadhwa-aquaria-grande/3009/project \"The Wadhwa Aquaria Grande\")\n\nBorivali West, Mumbai\n\nSend one enquiry to all selected projects and compare up to 4 options side-by-side.\n\n## Amann Infradevelopment Ltd Track Rec