7794.webp)\n\n![Property-Image](https://cdn.blox.xyz/projects-2x/amann-infra-development-amann-solitaire-elevation-1686727888.webp)VIEW ALL\n\n![Propert-Icon](https://cdn.blox.xyz/builders/thumb/140623124823-newproject-2023-06-14t124723160.webp)\n\n# Amann Solitaire\n\nAmann Solitaire society, Chandavarkar Rd, near food loads, Borivali West, Mumbai, Maharashtra 400092\n\nBorivali West\n\n₹2.14 Cr - 2.84 Cr\n\n₹2.14 Cr - 2.84 Cr\n\nBOOK PROPERTY\n\n[Price & Floor Plan](#Price & Floor Plan)\n\n![video-primary](/assets/icons/video-primary.svg)\n\n![call-rm](/assets/icons/call-rm.svg)\n\n![calendar-primary](/assets/icons/calendar-primary.svg)\n\nBOOK PROPERTY\n\n## Overview\n\nMumbai's residential project, Amann Solitaire B Wing is offering property for sale. Check out some Apartment. Available configurations include 2 BHK, 3 BHK formats in Borivali West. It is a Under Construction project by Amann Group. Amann Solitaire B Wing is set in an area of 1 Acres and is complete with various modern-day amenities... There are 77 units in Amann Solitaire B Wing. Amann Solitaire B Wing is located in Chandavarkar Road, Borivali Station Road, Borivali West. The property has Fire Protection And Fire Safety Requirements. Other provisions include access to Storm Water Drains.\n\nConfiguration\n\n2 BHK, 3 BHK\n\nReady to move\n\nCompleted in Jul 2022\n\nAvg. Price\n\n₹15,560/sq.ft\n\nRERA Carpet Area\n\n1375 - 1825 sqft\n\nWhy consider buying this property?\n\n* Discover an exclusive life at a futuristic destination\n* The pleasure of invisible care\n* Design oriented architecture\n\n* Spend your family time together\n* Strategically constructed\n\n## Google AI Summary\n\n✦\n\nOverall Satisfaction: The project is highly rated by home buyers for offering comfortable living spaces with ultra-modern apartments suitable for families. Structural Integrity: The tower construction is noted for modern specifications like spacious floor plans, wide windows, and good ventilation that allows ample natural light. Security System: The building has tight security measures including round-the-clock personnel and CCTV systems installed at critical points.\n\n![up-thumb](/assets/icons/up-thumb.svg)\n\n### The good things\n\nLocation Connectivity\n\nThe project is situated at a prime location in Borivali West, offering easy access to the local railway station and metro line.\n\nSocial Infrastructure\n\nEssential facilities including reputed schools, hospitals, supermarkets, and entertainment hubs are located in close proximity.\n\nFloor Configurations\n\nThe residential units feature Vastu-compliant layouts with spacious rooms and false ceilings.\n\n![down-thumb](/assets/icons/down-thumb.svg)\n\n### Needs improvement\n\nLimited Amenities\n\nThe society provides basic amenities but misses out on luxury premium options like a standalone clubhouse or swimming pool.\n\nExternal Congestion\n\nTraffic congestion during peak hours on major connecting roads like Link Road and SV Road can cause travel delays.\n\nParking Inadequacy\n\nInadequate space inside the premises leads to frequent parking issues for visitors and additional vehicles.\n\n---\n\nThe Verdict\n\nGreat for families\n\nSeamless daily commute\n\nGood value for money\n\nAvoid if luxury amenities are your priority\n\n## Amenities\n\n![amenities/jogging-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/jogging-secondary.svg)\n\nJogging / Cycle Track\n\n![amenities/kids-play-areas-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/kids-play-areas-secondary.svg)\n\nKids Play Areas / Sand Pits\n\n![amenities/large-green-area-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/large-green-area-secondary.svg)\n\nLarge Green Area\n\n![amenities/walking-area-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/walking-area-secondary.svg)\n\nWalking Area\n\n![amenities/jogging-primary](/assets/icons/amenities/jogging-primary.svg)\n\nJogging / Cycle Track\n\n![amenities/kids-play-areas-primary](/assets/icons/amenities/kids-play-areas-primary.svg)\n\nKids Play Areas / Sand Pits\n\n![a